{"signature": "9ccf13a801a63f1f2d462589d2025576c2e7d86342736868cc04cc4c1206b967", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "github", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests", "field": "author_login", "values": ["PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/223", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1166", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1166, "title": "New FTUE with objects appearing slowly", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Changed the FTUE for the first six levels. (Localization missing)\r\n\r\n- Added Harmony Games Object to StreakBar prefab. \r\n- The game now mostly speaks through Sophie and resembles a narrative of sorts with [PERSON_NAME_0077]'s new \"Tap to Continue\" action. \r\n- All bookmark and actual tutorials are now identical and will not break or give a different experience if the game is minimized. \r\n- Introducing a simple tutorial that combines hard level and extra tiles boost \r\n- Using \"Keep Object on Disable\" to slowly introduce UI elements. ", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "6b719bd4225ace7dda99eb02b7636a0870ab3cc9", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/ftue2.0", "head_sha": "1b63ebeabe2721d7328133a8812dc412ac67da8d", "additions": 945, "deletions": 746, "changed_files": 12, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-09-29T00:59:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-29T01:43:46Z", "merged_at": "2024-09-29T01:43:45Z", "closed_at": "2024-09-29T01:43:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/613", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1526", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1526, "title": "Vanishing tile tutorial unlock fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "The vanishing tile tutorial now doesn't unlock the booster UIs within the tutorial. Instead it locks them inside the tutorial but unlocks them in a silent tutorial upon level completion. All tutorial files is updated for normal ftue. ", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "51839b7ca83a08a545cf931aa7b9f826c0ace1d0", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/vanishingtutorialunlockfix", "head_sha": "396589f2b6f8325258bcfdf3dcd62ae3f3796829", "additions": 104, "deletions": 45, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:45:52Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-06T21:54:43Z", "merged_at": "2024-12-06T21:54:43Z", "closed_at": "2024-12-06T21:54:43Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/655", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1564", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1564, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Elon FTUE \r\n\r\nKnown issues: \r\n\r\n- Minigame screen missing\r\n- Plan B streak and bomb tutorials missing \r\n-Quest and leaderboard quests not tested on mobile \r\n- Milestone previews are broken \r\n\r\nThe rest is tested on Android #839 and iOS #690 by the design team ", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "3ccd45ae54f515ea9303d9fa60d308567d31c3ae", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue", "head_sha": "2d0f48603db38a5aa7391c3aa9003f7fcce376f6", "additions": 58825, "deletions": 332, "changed_files": 336, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-12-19T17:41:26Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-19T17:59:32Z", "merged_at": "2024-12-19T17:59:32Z", "closed_at": "2024-12-19T17:59:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/669", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1577", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1577, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Final Elon FTUE fixes \r\n\r\n* Temporary streak tutorial \r\n* Temporary bomb tutorial  \r\n* Fixed leaderboard and quest tutorial bugs reported \r\n* Fixed vanishing tile tutorial locks boosts if tutorial is quit midway \r\n* Fixed minigame button doesn't unlock after the pop up \r\n\r\nTested by [PERSON_NAME_0019] on Android 881  \r\n ", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "7042818f3a01a5e38edfb3952956293a8787cc44", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue", "head_sha": "f050a770aaae8ee040412c7efe7a551d028d4f5a", "additions": 1169, "deletions": 277, "changed_files": 22, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-12-21T01:42:41Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-21T13:27:14Z", "merged_at": "2024-12-21T13:27:14Z", "closed_at": "2024-12-21T13:27:14Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/684", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1590", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1590, "title": "Disable Lexi and Julius milestones", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Disable Lexi and Julius milestones in the Devboot script for the Elon FTUE", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "d35b8ee384d9621e475ccc5fa2dba7f3dc4c018b", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonmilestonefix", "head_sha": "7942b361230634f1b1ce1eb34c6ab11de22dcd9e", "additions": 3, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2024-12-23T17:30:34Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-23T18:03:32Z", "merged_at": "2024-12-23T18:03:32Z", "closed_at": "2024-12-23T18:03:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/707", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1610", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1610, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonhotfix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Elon FTUE levels 4-5-6 are the same as [PERSON_NAME_0036]'s FTUE\r\nThe first jumbo tile level objective requirements reduced \r\n\r\nTested by [PERSON_NAME_0019] on Android #992", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "502f61925ad4c07063f9af3fcf81086d598bc0a0", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonhotfix", "head_sha": "e56cd438f137fc99b79ea9c41ceec060b08de6c0", "additions": 646, "deletions": 593, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2024-12-27T21:34:15Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-27T23:31:06Z", "merged_at": "2024-12-27T23:31:05Z", "closed_at": "2024-12-27T23:31:05Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/752", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1651", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1651, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue 3", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Drawing tutorial and level are changed back to the original Elon plan. \r\n\r\n- Fixed streak tutorial is broken by fast-clicking.\r\n\r\nTested by [PERSON_NAME_0050] and [PERSON_NAME_0040] on Android #1085", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "5d8cc068efb2005d4ea5ff3b23acf8b1cb41f663", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0040]/elonftue-3", "head_sha": "bf9b9e293524007cafc3f55153780c9a6c5d5781", "additions": 635, "deletions": 623, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-01-17T16:20:22Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-17T22:08:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-01-17T22:08:55Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-17T22:08:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/813", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1706", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1706, "title": "Layout changes for bigger tiles ", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "40 Chapters optimized for bigger tiles. \r\n\r\n- layout changes\r\n- minor puzzle changes (objectives fixed after)\r\n\r\nTested on DD iOS - #1171 DD Android - #1306", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "b6e19df57e38c8a1187ef229984d3207ac6daa4f", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ENG-2116", "head_sha": "bca47690aca67c4c84f9495a8c47d9da32b07ef4", "additions": 37231, "deletions": 34317, "changed_files": 1775, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-02-14T20:35:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-18T20:08:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-18T20:08:48Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-18T20:08:48Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/846", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1736", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1736, "title": "12-19 objective fix", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "Chapter 12 level 19 now uses 2-3 vanishing tiles for 2 and 3 stars respectively, instead of the previous 3-6.", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "394caedf8cb91ea15f5986efbf916a14172f9285", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/chapter12objectivefix", "head_sha": "9ee8d9de9d7945aa05d59a5f0a0a787b8199f30e", "additions": 62, "deletions": 9, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0180_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-03-14T14:54:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-14T14:57:54Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-03-14T14:57:54Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/847", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1737", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1737, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/chapter12objectivefix", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "Chapter 12 levels 19 and 25 objectives are fixed to allow players to obtain 3 stars. ", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "394caedf8cb91ea15f5986efbf916a14172f9285", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/chapter12objectivefix", "head_sha": "4bb308eba0417d4dae7a868a3be46d1887b529f8", "additions": 123, "deletions": 17, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0180_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-03-14T14:59:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-14T17:48:16Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-03-14T17:48:16Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/923", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes#1805", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/GameOfDominoes", "number": 1805, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/globallayoutchanges", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Chapter 4-10 hard and epic levels layout changes for global launch", "base_ref": "develop", "base_sha": "6ea8e403e1ea91a6ac264cb8fa238730e6af5d67", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/globallayoutchanges", "head_sha": "cd22a50833b42dc825f2b04c89f6aa5921e89514", "additions": 2437, "deletions": 1558, "changed_files": 100, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0180_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-25T20:42:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-25T21:00:25Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-25T21:00:25Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-25T21:00:25Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2326", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#349", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 349, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/zombie swap", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Background changed\r\nZombies swapped with new art \r\nThe football player prefab received a color change. \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected animation clip names for multiple Zombie_Boxer animations, removing unnecessary trailing numbers for consistency.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Refined and enhanced the Zombie_Boxer_Run and Zombie_Boxer_TakeDamage animations with smoother transitions, improved keyframes, and more detailed motion.\n  * Significantly improved the Zombie_Mayor_Die animation with more detailed bone movements and smoother interpolation.\n  * Enhanced the Zombie_Karen_Die animation to activate the DeathSmoke visual effect during the death sequence.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "25351d9c5a4d68b53bf58757190daf36adf33f93", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/ZombieSwap", "head_sha": "d16ca7889454b12e33b6ebe9a945391dfe8f6d68", "additions": 8481, "deletions": 6472, "changed_files": 1382, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-31T17:09:53Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-31T17:14:44Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-31T17:14:44Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-31T17:14:44Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2328", "field": "author_login", "value": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#350", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 350, "title": "PR11,12,56,84 swap mistakes corrected", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Zombie swap fixes for 4 levels. Level files only  ", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ae0668b884d707edc2e6b6adc599faf75158b182", "head_r